brief:
A header banner for a conference's X (Twitter) profile, 1500×500 px, as a PNG.

- Background #111827, 64px padding.
- Fonts: Inter (regular and bold), in fonts/.
- On the left, stacked:
  - "LUMEN CONF 2027": Inter bold, 24px, #f87171, letter spacing 4px;
  - "Build what's next.": Inter bold, 80px, #ffffff, on one line;
  - "March 18–19, 2027 · Lisbon": Inter regular, 32px, #d1d5db.
- On the right, beside it and vertically centered: a card 420px wide, background #1f2937, 16px rounded corners, 32px padding, its contents stacked 12px apart:
  - "Early-bird tickets": Inter bold, 32px, #ffffff;
  - "Until January 31": Inter regular, 24px, #9ca3af;
  - a pill "Get tickets": Inter bold, 24px, #ffffff on #ef4444, fully rounded, 12px × 24px padding.
